    <p>Send us your enquiry and we'll respond within one business day with personalised assistance.</p>
    <a href="mailto:hello@elanora.in">hello@elanora.in</a>
    <a href="mailto:support@elanora.in">support@elanora.in</a>
  </div>
  <div class="contact-card">
    <div class="contact-card-icon">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0118 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h3>Visit Our Store</h3>
    <p>Experience our full collection in person at our flagship boutique in Kochi, Kerala.</p>
    <a href="https://maps.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get Directions →</a>
    <a href="#store" style="color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;">View Store Hours</a>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- MAIN CONTACT SECTION -->
<div class="contact-main">

  <!-- SIDEBAR INFO -->
  <div class="contact-info-sidebar">
    <span class="section-label">Get In Touch</span>
    <h2>Let's Start a<br><em>Conversation</em></h2>
    <p>Every great piece of jewellery begins with a conversation. Tell us about the occasion, the person, or the feeling you'd like to capture — and we'll create something truly unforgettable.</p>

    <div class="info-items">
      <div class="info-item">
