        </div>
        <div class="info-item-text">
          <strong>Flagship Boutique</strong>
          <span>42, MG Road, Marine Drive<br>Kochi, Kerala 682031</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="info-item">
        <div class="info-item-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l4 2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item-text">
          <strong>Business Hours</strong>
          <span>Mon – Sat: 10:00 AM – 7:30 PM<br>Sunday: 11:00 AM – 5:00 PM</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="info-item">
        <div class="info-item-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 013.07 10.8a19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 012 0h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L6.09 7.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 14.92v2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item-text">
          <strong>Customer Care</strong>
          <span>+91 800 123 4567<br>Response within 2 hours</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Follow Our Journey</p>
    <div class="social-links">
      <a href="#" class="social-btn" aria-label="Facebook">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 00-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 011-1h3z"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="social-btn" aria-label="Instagram">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1112.63 8 4 4 0 0116 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"/></svg>
