        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12c0 4.24 2.65 7.86 6.39 9.29-.09-.78-.17-1.98.04-2.83.18-.76 1.23-5.22 1.23-5.22s-.31-.63-.31-1.57c0-1.47.85-2.57 1.91-2.57.9 0 1.34.68 1.34 1.49 0 .91-.58 2.27-.88 3.53-.25 1.05.52 1.91 1.55 1.91 1.86 0 3.29-1.96 3.29-4.8 0-2.51-1.8-4.26-4.37-4.26-2.97 0-4.72 2.23-4.72 4.53 0 .9.34 1.85.78 2.38.08.1.09.19.07.29-.08.33-.26 1.05-.29 1.2-.04.19-.14.23-.32.14-1.25-.58-2.03-2.42-2.03-3.89 0-3.15 2.29-6.05 6.61-6.05 3.47 0 6.16 2.47 6.16 5.77 0 3.45-2.17 6.22-5.19 6.22-1.01 0-1.97-.53-2.3-1.15l-.62 2.33c-.23.87-.84 1.96-1.25 2.62.94.29 1.94.45 2.97.45 5.52 0 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2z"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="social-btn" aria-label="YouTube">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22.54 6.42a2.78 2.78 0 00-1.95-1.96C18.88 4 12 4 12 4s-6.88 0-8.59.46A2.78 2.78 0 001.46 6.42 29 29 0 001 12a29 29 0 00.46 5.58 2.78 2.78 0 001.95 1.96C5.12 20 12 20 12 20s6.88 0 8.59-.46a2.78 2.78 0 001.95-1.96A29 29 0 0023 12a29 29 0 00-.46-5.58z"/><polygon points="9.75,15.02 15.5,12 9.75,8.98 9.75,15.02"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- FORM -->
  <div class="contact-form-wrap">
    <h3>Send Us a Message</h3>
    <p>Fill in the form below and a member of our team will get back to you shortly.</p>

    <div id="contactForm">
      <div class="form-row">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="firstName">First Name *</label>
          <input type="text" id="firstName" placeholder="Elanora" required />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="lastName">Last Name *</label>
          <input type="text" id="lastName" placeholder="Grace" required />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="email">Email Address *</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="elanora@example.com" required />
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="phone">Phone Number</label>
        <input type="tel" id="phone" placeholder="+91 98765 43210" />
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="subject">Subject *</label>
        <select id="subject" required>
          <option value="" disabled selected>Select a topic…</option>
          <option>Product Enquiry</option>
          <option>Order Tracking</option>
          <option>Bespoke / Custom Jewellery</option>
          <option>Returns & Exchanges</option>
          <option>Wholesale / Partnership</option>
          <option>Other</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="message">Your Message *</label>
        <textarea id="message" placeholder="Tell us how we can help you…" required></textarea>
      </div>
      <div class="form-consent">
        <input type="checkbox" id="consent" required />
        <label for="consent">I agree to the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and consent to Elanora contacting me regarding my enquiry.</label>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="btn-submit" onclick="submitForm()">
        Send Message
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 2L11 13M22 2l-7 20-4-9-9-4 20-7z"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="form-success" id="formSuccess">
      <div class="success-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h4>Message Sent Successfully!</h4>
      <p>Thank you for reaching out. One of our team members will get back to you within 24 hours.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq">
  <div class="faq-header">
    <span class="section-label">Common Questions</span>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <p>Quick answers to the questions we hear most often. Can't find what you're looking for? Just reach out.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-grid">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
        How do I know if my jewellery is authentic?
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-answer">Every Elanora piece comes with a BIS hallmark certificate and a unique product ID that you can verify on our website. Our gemstones are certified by independent GIA-accredited labs.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
        Do you offer custom or bespoke jewellery?
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-answer">Absolutely. We love creating one-of-a-kind pieces. Share your vision with us via the contact form or visit our boutique, and our designers will work with you from concept to creation.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
        What is your return and exchange policy?
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-answer">We offer a 15-day hassle-free return policy for unworn items in original condition and packaging. Exchanges can be processed within 30 days. Custom orders are non-returnable.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
        How long does shipping take?
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-answer">Standard shipping takes 3–5 business days across India. Express delivery (1–2 business days) is available at checkout. All orders are insured and come in our signature gift packaging.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
        How do I care for my Elanora jewellery?
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-answer">Store jewellery in our provided pouch or box when not in use, away from moisture, perfumes, and chemicals. Wipe gently with a soft cloth after wearing. We offer complimentary cleaning at our boutique.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
        Do you ship internationally?
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-answer">Yes! We ship to 18 countries. International orders are fully insured and typically take 7–14 business days. Customs duties, if applicable, are the buyer's responsibility. Contact us for specific country availability.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

